<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>The <ref refid="classBPing" kindref="compound">BPing</ref> class is a child class of <ref refid="classBpSourcePattern" kindref="compound">BpSourcePattern</ref>. It is an app used for sending periodic, wait-for-a-response, bundles, to another bundle agent with a running echo service. The app copies a tiny payload to the bundle payload block containg a timestamp and sequence number. </para>
</sect1>
